To extract text from a document in JavaScript, you can use various libraries depending on the type of document (e.g., PDF, Word, HTML). Below is an example using **PDF.js** for extracting text from a PDF file and **html2canvas** for extracting text from an HTML document.

### 1. Extracting Text from a PDF (using PDF.js)
